<span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><span id="alg1.l13.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">// Sec. <a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3 Dynamic Importance Weighting ‣ 4 Method: SyTTA ‣ You only need 4 extra tokens: Synergistic Test-time Adaptation for LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a></span>
