<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Detailed results on <span id="A1.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DomainBench</span> and <span id="A1.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">InstructBench</span>. BERTScore-F1 scores (<math id="A1.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times 100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times 100</annotation></semantics></math> for visibility; higher is better). For each model and dataset, the highest score is <span id="A1.T4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> and the second-highest is <span id="A1.T4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</figcaption>
